{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951580/extras/95e9810de6e85f68d3784a23cdf6321e.poster.avif?t=1759391742\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951580/extras/95e9810de6e85f68d3784a23cdf6321e.webm?t=1759391742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take your first steps as Tidewalker</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this Demo, you experience the beginning of your journey as a Tidewalker, and discover one location from the opening act of the full game. Explore Marketland, a vibrant yet unstable island, shaped by the decisions of another player you choose to follow\u2014 a friend, a streamer, or a stranger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951580/extras/80786f9515b1f26f912806e90430a517.poster.avif?t=1759391742\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951580/extras/80786f9515b1f26f912806e90430a517.webm?t=1759391742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Locations are altered depending on who you follow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective: steal a stock of medicine from Obin, a feared marauder, in Marketland. However, this mission\u2014and the island itself\u2014 will be impacted by another player's actions! The state of Marketland, its inhabitants, gameplay opportunities, and overall atmosphere will fluctuate depending on the player you follow. You may encounter stealth sequences, high-stakes chases, tense dialogues, or moments of investigation and persuasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951580/extras/cc19d7ec04a098f0ee4046855cb4a811.poster.avif?t=1759391742\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951580/extras/cc19d7ec04a098f0ee4046855cb4a811.webm?t=1759391742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replay the demo for a different experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay the demo by following a different player to uncover new gameplay, storylines, and consequences. Each run offers a unique perspective shaped by asynchronous multiplayer storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The demo is also fully playable offline by following premade profiles.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951580/extras/e24e465cec7d277444b3b20a1e33c0b7.poster.avif?t=1759391742\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951580/extras/e24e465cec7d277444b3b20a1e33c0b7.webm?t=1759391742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey with a 40-minute demo introducing core mechanics of the full game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow another player and experience a level reshaped by their past decisions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay the demo by following different players and explore new outcomes, gameplay styles and storylines.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face different challenges depending on the previous player\u2019s choices\u2014stealth, chase, persuasion, or investigation.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Marketland, meet three key characters, and interact with NPCs who remember the previous player\u2019s choices.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951580?t=1759391742","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951580/2e4d257ae3e2b690f116a24ff64fd6813eedae25/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759391742","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951580/cbb322d71da68abedb985731f5d8c21c459aacf9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759391742","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951580/cbb322d71da68abedb985731f5d8c21c459aacf9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759391742","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951580/extras/95e9810de6e85f68d3784a23cdf6321e.poster.avif?t=1759391742\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951580/extras/95e9810de6e85f68d3784a23cdf6321e.webm?t=1759391742\" ty