11.webm?t=1759391742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replay the demo for a different experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay the demo by following a different player to uncover new gameplay, storylines, and consequences. Each run offers a unique perspective shaped by asynchronous multiplayer storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The demo is also fully playable offline by following premade profiles.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951580/extras/e24e465cec7d277444b3b20a1e33c0b7.poster.avif?t=1759391742\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951580/extras/e24e465cec7d277444b3b20a1e33c0b7.webm?t=1759391742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey with a 40-minute demo introducing core mechanics of the full game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow another player and experience a level reshaped by their past decisions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay the demo by following different players and explore new outcomes, gameplay styles and storylines.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face different challenges depending on the previous player\u2019s choices\u2014stealth, chase, persuasion, or investigation.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Marketland, meet three key characters, and interact with NPCs who remember the previous player\u2019s choices.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Digixart"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2678080","name":"Tides of Tomorrow \ud83c\udf0a"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"h